{"run_id": "20260802T233608-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-0083af62", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2209.07327 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2209.07327 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- \\( pp \\rightarrow B \\overline{B} \\) (vector-like B quark pair production)\n- \\( pp \\rightarrow T \\overline{T} \\) (vector-like T quark pair production)\n\nThese processes are explicitly mentioned in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2209.07327"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2209.07327"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.001}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:pp-to-bbbar-vlq", "hepkg:process:pp-to-ttbar-vlq"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:82483f23e0c9cfe7fdb69baf"], "seen_values": ["2209.07327", "bbar", "hepkg:process:pp-to-bbbar-vlq", "hepkg:process:pp-to-ttbar-vlq", "pair", "physics_process", "production", "quark", "result_targets_process", "tbar", "vector-like"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 6997, "completion_tokens": 112, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 5.032376541988924, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 5.032376541988924, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7109.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 2.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 1.0}}
{"run_id": "20260802T233608-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-01581c67", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many statistical methods does analysis 2403.01556 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2403.01556 uses two statistical methods:\n\n1. **CLs criterion for 95% CL upper limits**\n2. **Likelihood ratio test statistic q(μ) for confidence intervals**\n\nThese methods are recorded in the graph as being used in this analysis.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2403.01556", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2403.01556"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.005}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:statmethod:cls-criterion", "hepkg:statmethod:likelihood-ratio-test-statistic"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1c1194ee96ec38f30f1664c7", "hepkg:evidence:e9dd2a02ab68b502eacd126a"], "seen_values": ["2403.01556", "95", "cls", "confidence", "criterion", "for", "hepkg:statmethod:cls-criterion", "hepkg:statmethod:likelihood-ratio-test-statistic", "intervals", "likelihood", "limits", "ratio", "result_uses_statistical_method", "statistic", "statistical_method", "test", "upper"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7004, "completion_tokens": 111, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 4.916113750019576, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 4.916113750019576, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7115.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 2.0}}
{"run_id": "20260802T233608-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-01da5919", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2004.04545 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2004.04545 defines 14 object selection requirements. These include criteria for photon invariant mass, transverse momentum, jet and lepton selections, and identification requirements. \n\nFor example, some of the selection requirements are:\n- \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\in [105, 160] \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 35 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}}/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.25 \\)\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}}/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.35 \\)\n- \\(\\geq 1\\) jet with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV containing a b-hadron\n- \\(\\geq 1\\) lepton with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 15 \\) GeV\n- \\(\\geq 2\\) additional jets with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV\n- \\(\\geq 3\\) additional jets\n- Isolated\n- Medium identification\n- No selected lepton (veto)\n- Not reconstructed for events containing more than one lepton\n- Tight identification\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are crucial for the analysis. \n\nHere is the full list of selection requirements:\n\n- \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\in [105, 160] \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 35 \\) GeV\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}}/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.25 \\)\n- \\( p_{\\text{T}}/m_{\\gamma\\gamma} > 0.35 \\)\n- \\(\\geq 1\\) jet with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV containing a b-hadron\n- \\(\\geq 1\\) lepton with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 15 \\) GeV\n- \\(\\geq 2\\) additional jets with \\( p_{\\text{T}} > 25 \\) GeV\n- \\(\\geq 3\\) additional jets\n- Isolated\n- Medium identification\n- No selected lepton (veto)\n- Not reconstructed for events containing more than one lepton\n- Tight identification\n\nThis information is directly extracted from the paper 2004.04545.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2004.04545 defines 14 object selection requirements. These include criteria for photon invariant mass, transverse momentum, jet and lepton selections, and identification requirements. For example, some of the selection requirements are: - \\( m_{\\\\gamma\\\\gamma} \\\\in [105, 160] \\\\) GeV - \\( p_{\\\\text{T}} > 25 \\\\) GeV - \\( p_{\\\\text{T}} > 35 \\\\) GeV - \\( p_{\\\\text{T}}/m_{\\\\gamma\\\\gamma} > 0.25 \\\\) - \\( p_{\\\\text{T}}/m_{\\\\gamma\\\\gamma} > 0.35 \\\\) - \\\\(\\\\geq 1\\\\) jet with \\( p_{\\\\text{T}} > 25 \\\\) GeV containing a b-hadron - \\\\(\\\\geq 1\\\\) lepton with \\( p_{\\\\text{T}} >", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.04545"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b7e49bdf97fdec123939dca", "hepkg:evidence:0d7349e0f3f9c04485db0381", "hepkg:evidence:1a90e81fe6e2599c6be5a3d2", "hepkg:evidence:218c0751daadc168fe290a22", "hepkg:evidence:62f230fa65c5322728910eca", "hepkg:evidence:876c88f577a502b91fa5718c", "hepkg:evidence:b653e88455639e19d8c28730", "hepkg:evidence:ed7651bcac41408dd0985084"], "seen_values": ["0.25", "0.35", "1", "105,160", "10516", "105160", "15", "2", "2004.04545", "25", "3", "35", "additional", "b-hadron", "containing", "events", "for", "gamma", "gev", "identification", "isolated", "jet", "jets", "lepton", "medium", "more", "none", "not", "object_has_selection", "one", "reconstructed", "selected", "text", "than", "tight", "veto", "with"], "verification_score": 0.75, "unsupported_claims": ["105", "160"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7614, "completion_tokens": 838, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 35.568728249985725, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 35.568728249985725, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 8452.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errore