{"run_id": "20260802T233608-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-02b65978", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2208.12095 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2208.12095 measures the following observables:\n\n- Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\n- Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph with the following evidence:\n\n- For \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\): \"Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\"\n- For \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\): \"Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2208.12095 measures these two observables.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2208.12095 measures the following observables:\\n\\n- Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\)\\n- Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\)\\n\\nThese observables are recorded in the graph with the following evidence:\\n\\n- For \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\): \\\"Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\)\\\"\\n- For \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\): \\\"Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\)\\\"\\n\\nTherefore, the analysis 2208.12095 measures these two observables.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2208.12095"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.006}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:obser